                                "sense_id": "6eda01fe-26c5-3a44-bd24-dd1c9aa73c1d",
                                "text": "1988, Liberia-forum, Issues 6-9, Liberia Working Group, page 53,\nHe supported the assumption of administrative and management functions by Africans, the literation of African languages; as well as agriculture, mining and banking by African enterprises; public health services staffed by African doctors etc."
                            },
